    },
    {
      "text": "After Lady White Rabbit recovers from Black Tigress, her cultivation falls from rank seven to rank six. Fang Yuan, having inherited Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance, understands Black Tigress true inheritance: the cultivator normally accumulates strength and bursts with outstanding battle strength beyond usual limits, but develops two personalities, a dark sinister side and a pure innocent side. In ordinary life the pure side is weak; when life is threatened or mood is intensely agitated, the dark side takes over with strong battle strength that lasts only a short time. Both sides share senses and memories but usually differ in thought process. Fang Yuan rates Black Tigress as first rate among rank seven, but not stable.",
